MODULE: ReadyCrashForgetsCompletion
TARGET: HistoryExact
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: A restart forgets applied revision identities while their durable history rows survive
PERTURBS: Crash

--- FIND
    /\ UNCHANGED <<ckpt,done,value,history,snapshots,historySnapshots>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ done' = [done EXCEPT ![c] = {}]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<ckpt,value,history,snapshots,historySnapshots>>
--- END
